{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261029/photo/bkn-20261029220202667-1029_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261029222429\"/><p>私家車起火後猛烈燃燒。</p><p>今晚(29日)9時18分，赤柱村道66號對開，一輛私家車車頭突然冒煙起火，司機見狀即時棄車逃生，並致電報案。由於火勢迅速蔓延，一時間全車陷於火海之中，濃煙捲上半空。消防接報到場開喉，未幾將火救熄，事件中無人受傷，起火原因待查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:01:18.082092+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T14:02:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T15:18:20.380068+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T14:58:21.827081+00:00","content_hash":"b8054266410ba8256b0c787a5ae84486ed6c66abda7199742fb22d62e6431c4b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:01:18.082092+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}